<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Assistant BJT Complete — Club Électronique</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; }

header { background: #0f172a; color: white; padding: 16px 24px 0 24px; }
header h1 { margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 22px; }
header p { margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; }

.tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
.tab-btn {
  padding: 12px 24px; background: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; border: none;
  border-top-left-radius: 8px; border-top-right-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; font-size: 14px;
}
.tab-btn:hover { background: #334155; color: white; }
.tab-btn.active { background: #f1f5f9; color: #2563eb; border-top: 3px solid #2563eb; }

main { max-width: 1280px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.tab-content { display: none; }
.tab-content.active { display: block; }

.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
.card { background: white; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
.span-1 { grid-column: span 1; }
.span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

h2 { margin-top: 0; color: #0f172a; font-size: 16px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; }
input[type="number"] { width: 100px; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius: 4px; text-align: right; }

.btn-group { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
button { flex: 1; padding: 10px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: #2563eb; color: white; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
button.secondary { background: #475569; }
button.secondary:hover { background: #334155; }
button.action-next { background: #059669; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px; }
button.action-next:hover { background: #047857; }
button.action-back { background: #d97706; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px; }
button.action-back:hover { background: #b45309; }

/* Style du Toggle Switch */
.switch-container {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 12px;
}
.switch-label { font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; }
.switch { position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 48px; height: 24px; }
.switch input { opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0; }
.slider {
  position: absolute; cursor: pointer; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  background-color: #cbd5e1; transition: .3s; border-radius: 24px;
}
.slider:before {
  position: absolute; content: ""; height: 18px; width: 18px; left: 3px; bottom: 3px;
  background-color: white; transition: .3s; border-radius: 50%;
}
input:checked + .slider { background-color: #2563eb; }
input:checked + .slider:before { transform: translateX(24px); }

.results { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.metric { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; }
.metric span { font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; display: block; }
.metric b { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 14px; }

canvas { display: block; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px; }
#schematicCanvas { height: 280px; }
#quadrantsCanvas { height: 600px; }
#acSchematicCanvas { height: 260px; }
#bodeCanvas { height: 400px; }

.ok { color: #059669; font-weight: bold; }
.danger { color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold; }
.warn { color: #d97706; font-weight: bold; }
.checkbox-label { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 8px; cursor: pointer; }
.checkbox-label input { width: auto; }
.note-box { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #1e40af; }
.calc-box { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #14532d; }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>Assistant BJT — Spécial Club Débutants</h1>
  <p>Polarisation Statique (DC), Point Q, Saturation, Blocage & Dimensionnement AC</p>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('tab-dc')">1. Régime Statique (DC & Point Q)</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab-ac')">2. Régime Dynamique (AC & Amplification)</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- PAGE 1 : STATIQUE -->
<div id="tab-dc" class="tab-content active">
  <div class="grid">
    <section class="card span-1">
      <h2>1. Dimensionnement Automatique</h2>
      <div class="note-box">
        💡 <b>Hypothèses standards retenues :</b><br>
        • $V_E = 10\% \times V_{CC}$ (Stabilité)<br>
        • $V_{CE} = (V_{CC} - V_E) / 2$ (Lois de polarisation)
      </div>
      <label>VCC Tension d'alim (V) <input id="dv" type="number" value="12" step="0.1" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>IC souhaité (mA) <input id="di" type="number" value="25" step="1" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>VCE sat (V) <input id="dvsat" type="number" value="0.2" step="0.05" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>PD max Transistor (mW) <input id="dpdmax" type="number" value="300" step="10" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>Tension Early VA (V) <input id="dva" type="number" value="100" step="10" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>Gain β (hFE) <input id="db" type="number" value="120" step="5" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>Ratio VE / VCC <input id="df" type="number" value="0.10" step="0.01" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>Ratio Ipont / IB <input id="dr" type="number" value="10" step="1" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <label>VBE Tension Base (V) <input id="dbe" type="number" value="0.75" step="0.01" onchange="designDC()"></label>
      <div class="btn-group">
